<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-420] Improve notebook clone behavior</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-420</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When user clones notebook, it clones all the information of the notebook even that shouldn&apos;t be copied such as paragraph id, job id, paragraph status(running, pending).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Instead of adding clone paragraphs itself, should create new paragraphs and copy only the contents(code, result, title) to new paragraph.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Keep show/hide config of original note.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
